# Week 5 – Token Economics: Cost and Rate-Limit Budgeting

## 1. Project Overview

This project focuses on understanding and implementing Token Economics in Generative AI applications. It estimates the cost of API usage based on input tokens, output tokens, daily requests, and monthly budgets.

The project also evaluates API rate limits, including Requests Per Minute (RPM) and Tokens Per Minute (TPM), to ensure that an application operates within defined usage limits.

## 2. Objectives

- Understand token-based pricing in Generative AI APIs.
- Calculate input and output token costs.
- Estimate daily and monthly API expenses.
- Monitor Requests Per Minute (RPM).
- Monitor Tokens Per Minute (TPM).
- Apply safety margins to cost and usage calculations.
- Check whether the application stays within its daily and monthly budget.
- Identify potential rate-limit violations.

